   "stem": "<p>The diagram shows the net of a solid cone.<br>It is made from a sector of a circle of radius 10&nbsp;cm and a circle of radius 6&nbsp;cm.<br>[The curved surface area of a cone, <i>A</i> = \u03c0<i>rl</i>.]</p>",
   "parts": [
    {
     "t": "Show that the angle of the sector is 216\u00b0.",
     "ans": "",
     "m": 2
    },
    {
     "t": "Calculate the curved surface area of the cone.<br>Give your answer correct to 3 significant figures.",
     "ans": "",
