   ],
   "ms": [
    [
     "216",
     "2",
     "M1 for arc of sector = circumference of base, <sup><i>x</i></sup>&frasl;<sub>360</sub> &times; 2 &times; \u03c0 &times; 10 = 2 &times; \u03c0 &times; 6 oe<br>A1 nfww"
    ],
    [
     "188 or 188.4\u2026",
     "2",
     "M1 for \u03c0 &times; 6 &times; 10 or <sup>216</sup>&frasl;<sub>360</sub> &times; \u03c0 &times; 10<sup>2</sup><br>A1 (exact 60\u03c0)"
    ],
    [
     "302 or 301.5\u2026",
     "1",
     "B1<br>their 188.4\u2026 + \u03c0 &times; 6<sup>2</sup> (exact 96\u03c0)<br>FT"
    ]
   ],
   "sols": [
    [
     [
      "When the net is folded, the arc of the sector becomes the circumference of the base circle.",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Circumference of the base = 2 &times; \u03c0 &times; 6 = 12\u03c0&nbsp;cm",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Arc of the sector = <sup><i>x</i></sup>&frasl;<sub>360</sub> &times; 2 &times; \u03c0 &times; 10 = <sup><i>x</i></sup>&frasl;<sub>360</sub> &times; 20\u03c0",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "<sup><i>x</i></sup>&frasl;<sub>360</sub> &times; 20\u03c0 = 12\u03c0, so <sup><i>x</i></sup>&frasl;<sub>360</sub> = <sup>12</sup>&frasl;<sub>20</sub> = 0.6",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "<i>x</i> = 0.6 &times; 360 = <b>216\u00b0</b>",
      ""
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "Curved surface area = \u03c0<i>rl</i> = \u03c0 &times; 6 &times; 10 = 60\u03c0",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "This is the same as the sector area <sup>216</sup>&frasl;<sub>360</sub> &times; \u03c0 &times; 10<sup>2</sup> = 60\u03c0 \u2713",
      "the sector is the curved surface"
     ],
     [
      "Curved surface area = <b>188&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup></b> (3 s.f.)",
      "188.495\u2026"
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "Base circle = \u03c0 &times; 6<sup>2</sup> = 36\u03c0&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup>.",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Total = 60\u03c0 + 36\u03c0 = 96\u03c0 = 301.59\u2026",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Total surface area = <b>302&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup></b> (3 s.f.)",
      ""
     ]
    ]
   ]
