   "stem": "<p>A closed box is a cuboid with a square base of side <i>x</i>&nbsp;cm and height 3<i>x</i>&nbsp;cm.<br>The diagram shows the net of the box.</p>",
   "parts": [
    {
     "t": "Show that the total surface area of the box is 14<i>x</i><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup>.",
     "ans": "",
     "m": 2
    },
    {
     "t": "The total surface area of the box is 350&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup>.<br>Find the value of <i>x</i>.",
     "ans": "<i>x</i> =",
     "m": 2
    },
    {
     "t": "Calculate the volume of the box.",
     "ans": "",
     "unit": "cm<sup>3</sup>",
     "m": 2
