   ],
   "ms": [
    [
     "14<i>x</i><sup>2</sup>",
     "2",
     "M1 for 2 &times; <i>x</i><sup>2</sup> + 4 &times; <i>x</i> &times; 3<i>x</i> oe<br>A1 for 2<i>x</i><sup>2</sup> + 12<i>x</i><sup>2</sup> = 14<i>x</i><sup>2</sup> nfww"
    ],
    [
     "5",
     "2",
     "M1 for 14<i>x</i><sup>2</sup> = 350 or <i>x</i><sup>2</sup> = 25<br>A1 cao (positive root only)"
    ],
    [
     "375",
     "2",
     "M1 for 5 &times; 5 &times; 15 or 3 &times; 5<sup>3</sup><br>A1 cao"
    ]
   ],
   "sols": [
    [
     [
      "The net has two squares of side <i>x</i> and four rectangles <i>x</i> by 3<i>x</i>.",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Surface area = 2 &times; <i>x</i><sup>2</sup> + 4 &times; (<i>x</i> &times; 3<i>x</i>)",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "= 2<i>x</i><sup>2</sup> + 12<i>x</i><sup>2</sup>",
      "4 &times; 3<i>x</i><sup>2</sup> = 12<i>x</i><sup>2</sup>"
     ],
     [
      "Surface area = <b>14<i>x</i><sup>2</sup></b>&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup>",
      ""
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "14<i>x</i><sup>2</sup> = 350",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "<i>x</i><sup>2</sup> = <sup>350</sup>&frasl;<sub>14</sub> = 25",
      "divide both sides by 14"
     ],
     [
      "<i>x</i> = <b>5</b>",
      "<i>x</i> is a length, so take the positive root"
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "The box measures 5&nbsp;cm by 5&nbsp;cm by 15&nbsp;cm.",
      "3<i>x</i> = 15"
     ],
     [
      "Volume = 5 &times; 5 &times; 15",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Volume = <b>375&nbsp;cm<sup>3</sup></b>",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Check: 14 &times; 5<sup>2</sup> = 350 \u2713",
      ""
     ]
    ]
   ]
